cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this eval, please cite it by its release tag."
type: dataset
title: "Skill vs playbook: does packaging change whether agents use a domain CLI well?"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered eval of whether a CLI's agent guidance should ship as an
  Agent Skill or as a document behind a CLAUDE.md pointer. 222 headless
  Claude Code trials across Haiku 4.5 and Sonnet 5.5, graded
  deterministically, with a blind LLM judge calibrated against human labels.
authors:
